=== QA001 | more than the eight parameters q allows
f:{[a;b;c;d;e;f;g;h;i] a}

=== clean | exactly eight is legal
f:{[a;b;c;d;e;f;g;h] a}

=== QA002 | more arguments than the literal lambda takes
{[a;b]a+b}[1;2;3]

=== clean | the right number
{[a;b]a+b}[1;2]

=== clean | an elided argument is a projection, not an error
{[a;b]a+b}[1;]

=== QA004 | applying a niladic function to the empty list
f:{[] 1};f . ()

=== clean | the same shape where the function takes an argument
f:{[a] 1};f . enlist 1
